<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-πτῠχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύξ, πτυχή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>with many folds;</i> esp. of
			mountains, <i>with many valleys,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυπτύχου Οὐλύμποιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.411
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				113
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴδης ἐν κνημοῖσι πολυπτύχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.449
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.171
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών,</span> of the
			mountainous tract of Phocis, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				677
			</span></i>; of a compress, <i>many times folded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>folded many times, with many leaves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμματεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
